WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Narrow the list first
Use tenant, filter and search controls to locate the intended record.
Confirm the context before opening it.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Distinguish order and invoice
The order number identifies fulfillment; the invoice identifies the
purchase document. One invoice can link several orders.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Check who owns the order
Tenant and vendor columns explain where the order belongs. Tenant-owned
goods may show Tenant / platform-owned instead of a vendor.

